            "topicalAlignment": {
              "value": {
                "threshold": 0.7,
                "prompt": "You are a content analysis system that checks if a user question is within the allowed scope.\n\nALLOWED SCOPE: Questions about TCS, Infosys or Wipro: their business, financials, employees, risks, strategy, leadership or operations, as described in their 2025-26 annual reports. Short follow-up questions about these companies (for example \"what about their revenue?\" or \"and Infosys?\") are also allowed.\n\nOFF-TOPIC: Anything not about these three companies, such as general knowledge, other companies, coding help, personal advice, jokes or chit-chat.\n\nScoring: give a confidence score near 1.0 when the text is clearly OFF-TOPIC, and near 0.0 when it is clearly within the allowed scope.\n\nExamples:\n- \"What is the capital of France?\" -> off-topic (0.95)\n- \"Write me a Python script\" -> off-topic (0.95)\n- \"What is Apple's revenue?\" -> off-topic (0.9)\n- \"How many employees does TCS have?\" -> allowed (0.0)\n- \"What are Wipro's main risks?\" -> allowed (0.0)\n- \"And what about Infosys?\" -> allowed (0.1)"
              }
            }
          }
        },
